<view class="tech-page"><view class="tech-head"><view><view class="tech-title">上门日程</view><view class="tech-subtitle">按时间安排，做好每次服务准备</view></view><view class="tech-avatar"><van-icon name="calendar-o" size="28px" /></view></view><view class="tech-tabs"><view wx:for="{{filters}}" wx:key="key" class="tech-tab {{filter===item.key?'tech-tab--active':''}}" data-filter="{{item.key}}" bindtap="onFilter">{{item.text}}</view></view><tech-state wx:if="{{loading}}" loading /><tech-state wx:elif="{{error}}" error title="日程暂未同步" description="{{error}}" action="重新读取" bind:retry="load" /><block wx:else><view class="schedule-date">{{dateText}} <text>{{items.length}} 项安排</text></view><tech-task-card wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" task="{{item}}" bind:open="onTask" /><tech-state wx:if="{{!items.length}}" title="暂无上门安排" description="已接任务有预约时间后，将按日期出现在这里。" /><view class="tech-bottom-note">预约是否已确认，以上门任务详情为准</view></block></view>
